## 2. Narzędzia online (target: wszystkie A+)

### securityheaders.com

```
URL: https://securityheaders.com/?q={{PROD_DOMAIN}}&followRedirects=on
Target: Grade A lub A+
```

Wymagane by checklist:
- [ ] Strict-Transport-Security: present + PASS
- [ ] Content-Security-Policy: present (nie WARN)
- [ ] X-Frame-Options: present + DENY
- [ ] X-Content-Type-Options: present + nosniff
- [ ] Referrer-Policy: present
- [ ] Permissions-Policy: present

### observatory.mozilla.org

```
URL: https://observatory.mozilla.org/analyze/{{PROD_DOMAIN}}
Target: Grade A+ (100/100)
```

Wymagane:
- [ ] Content Security Policy: 25/25
- [ ] Cookies: SameSite, HttpOnly, Secure flags (iron-session ustawia automatycznie)
- [ ] HTTPS: present
- [ ] HSTS: present + preload
- [ ] Redirects: www → apex HTTPS

### csp-evaluator.withgoogle.com

```
URL: https://csp-evaluator.withgoogle.com/
```

Wklej wartość headera CSP (bez `Content-Security-Policy:`).
Target: "No high severity findings"

Akceptowalne warnings (NIE errors):
- `'unsafe-inline'` w `style-src` — Tailwind wymaga, CSS XSS nie jest krytyczne
- `report-uri` deprecated → `report-to` — opcjonalna migracja

NIE akceptowalne:
- `'unsafe-eval'` w script-src → BLOKER
- Wildcards `*` w script-src → BLOKER
- `data:` w script-src → BLOKER

