## 3. TLS certificate check

```bash
DOMAIN="{{PROD_DOMAIN}}"

# Weryfikacja certyfikatu Let's Encrypt
echo | openssl s_client -connect "${DOMAIN}:443" -servername "${DOMAIN}" 2>/dev/null \
  | openssl x509 -noout -dates -issuer

# Oczekiwane:
#   notAfter=<data > 30 dni>
#   issuer=O=Let's Encrypt

# TLS grade
# Narzędzie: https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/analyze.html?d={{PROD_DOMAIN}}
# Target: Grade A
```

